WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.979 --> 00:00:04.950
Hey Youtubers it’s Charlie, so much to talk
about in this edition of Marvel Tuesday.

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:08.450
There’s been a whole lot of Avengers 2 stuff
coming from the set, like Ultron picks and

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:09.900
a brand new Iron Man suit.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:14.679
Plus in a recent interview Chris Evans talked
about not playing Captain America anymore.

00:00:14.679 --> 00:00:19.170
So I’m going to start this video with a
question.

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:21.130
What would happen if, In Avengers 2.

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:22.939
The Avengers weren’t the good guys.

00:00:22.939 --> 00:00:25.449
What if the rest of the world thought of them
as the villains?

00:00:25.449 --> 00:00:29.119
I have a couple of big reasons I think this
is going to be the case, for at least the

00:00:29.119 --> 00:00:30.949
biggest part of the story.

00:00:30.949 --> 00:00:35.050
And I’ll address some of those Captain America
rumors as it applies to an Avengers roster

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:36.090
change.

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:38.160
Because it all ties together.

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:41.710
Real quick though, if you’re finding me
for the first time and saying WTF Marvel Tuesday,

00:00:41.710 --> 00:00:46.170
I just make Marvel Movie videos every Tuesday,
just because I’m usually already doing Agents

00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:47.230
of SHIELD stuff.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:51.690
Be sure to subscribe to get everything and
please leave your suggestions for future movie

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:53.120
videos to do.

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:55.320
So what’s this about evil Avengers.

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:58.270
This isn’t going to be a version of Dark
Avengers.

00:00:58.270 --> 00:01:00.449
Which came after Civil War in the comics.

00:01:00.449 --> 00:01:03.140
It was just a bunch of Super Villains disguised
as superheroes.

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:09.050
No, I’m talking more about popular opinion
as it applies to hero worship in the Marvel

00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:10.370
Universe.

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:13.910
So first off we have to talk about fandoms.

00:01:13.910 --> 00:01:16.450
Remember way back in the first Iron Man movie.

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:20.540
Robert Downey Jr came out as Iron Man during
a live press conference.

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:24.270
He never hid his identity and became this
larger than life personality.

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:26.900
Then after the battle of New York in the first
Avengers movie.

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:30.350
They all became celebrities inside that Universe,
they’re all worshipped as heroes.

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:34.580
So what happens when they lose the public
trust and everyone starts hating them.

00:01:34.580 --> 00:01:38.920
It’s almost unthinkable, why in the name
of Odin would normal people hate The Avengers?

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:40.520
I have a couple theories.

00:01:40.520 --> 00:01:42.390
Let’s look at the plot.

00:01:42.390 --> 00:01:47.850
We know it’s loosely inspired by the comic
Mighty Avengers, beginning after Civil War.

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:54.170
Ultron, who already existed via Hank Pym,
co-opts one of Tony Stark’s Iron Man suits.

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:57.350
And for a little while, it seems like Iron
Man is the villain.

00:01:57.350 --> 00:01:59.100
Albeit a fake Iron Man.

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:00.610
But normal people don’t know that.

00:02:00.610 --> 00:02:04.060
So you can see why people might start hating
on the Avengers.

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:06.250
The movie is a little different.

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:09.030
Because Ultron doesn’t exist yet, as far
as we know.

00:02:09.030 --> 00:02:11.180
He has to have an origin story.

00:02:11.180 --> 00:02:14.459
In the comics, Hank Pym creates him.

00:02:14.459 --> 00:02:17.390
In the movies, because we won’t see that
character until three months after Avengers

00:02:17.390 --> 00:02:21.079
2, they changed the origin.

00:02:21.079 --> 00:02:27.329
Now Ultron is loosely based on a Military
version of JARVIS, that just spins out of

00:02:27.329 --> 00:02:28.329
control.

00:02:28.329 --> 00:02:31.909
Captain America The Winter Soldier kind of
sets the stage for how all this is possible.

00:02:31.909 --> 00:02:36.799
How the military could come into possession
of something so dangerous as a rogue AI.

00:02:36.799 --> 00:02:41.060
But because it’s essentially Stark Tech,
the Avengers get blamed.

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:42.560
By the public that is.

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:44.849
And you get your ‘evil Avengers’.

00:02:44.849 --> 00:02:49.730
But there’s so much other stuff that has
to happen in this movie to resolve the Ultron

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:54.790
situation and set things up for Phase 3 and
the Infinity Gems.

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:58.230
What has to happen in order for people to
believe in the Avengers again?

00:02:58.230 --> 00:03:04.640
You have to kill one of them, you have to
kill one of the bright shining stars of the

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:05.640
Avengers.

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:06.640
Captain America.

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:07.819
Crazy, I know.

00:03:07.819 --> 00:03:10.549
But it’s been done before, for different
reasons.

00:03:10.549 --> 00:03:15.629
Remember Captain America died at the conclusion
of Civil War, before being resurrected later.

00:03:15.629 --> 00:03:18.200
So even if Joss Whedon kills him, he’ll
be back.

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:24.040
Remember, there’s no such thing as permanent
death in comic books and comic book movies.

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:26.620
Why do I think it’s going to be Captain
America?

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:30.519
Mostly because in a recent interview, Chris
Evans said he thinks he’ll be done with

00:03:30.519 --> 00:03:32.739
the character by 2017.

00:03:32.739 --> 00:03:36.569
Which is just enough time to squeeze out a
third Captain America film.

00:03:36.569 --> 00:03:41.019
And there have been rumors that the Winter
Soldier might potentially replace him.

00:03:41.019 --> 00:03:44.829
Which happened after he was killed in the
comics during Civil War.

00:03:44.829 --> 00:03:48.299
If you’re not familiar, I’m talking about
the character of The Winter Soldier taking

00:03:48.299 --> 00:04:04.560
up the costume and shield of Captain America,
not Sebastian Stan.

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:11.719
The alternate theory is that it’s Hawkeye
who will be killed, Coulson style, to bring

00:04:11.719 --> 00:04:12.920
everyone together.

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:16.799
Meaning Captain America’s death could just
be postponed till the third film.

00:04:16.799 --> 00:04:24.410
Either way, the Avengers will be very unpopular
until something catalyzes public opinion post-Ultron.

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:31.630
And Chris Evans’ status as Captain America
was just upgraded to ‘might be gone soon’.

00:04:31.630 --> 00:04:34.270
If you consider 2017 to be soon.

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:39.390
In my opinion major roster changes in characters
and actors in general isn’t going to happen

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:43.010
until Avengers 3, maybe even phase 4.

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:47.620
Even the most expensive person, Robert Downey
Jr, has a contract that extends through Avengers

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:48.620
3.

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:51.120
Which is scheduled for 2019 right now.

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:54.531
So now it’s your turn to let me know, do
you think everyone is going to blame Tony

00:04:54.531 --> 00:04:58.400
Stark and the Avengers for the creation of
Ultron and all the destruction he causes?

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:02.690
And what is going to happen to fix that?

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:04.600
I think it has to be a dead Avenger.

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:07.120
Who it is, is still up for debate.

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:09.870
So Captain America is out next week.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:15.280
I’ll post a review of that Thursday night,
not this thursday, next week.

00:05:15.280 --> 00:05:16.530
Be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:05:16.530 --> 00:05:24.030
I’ll probably do my next Marvel Movie video
on my top picks for new Avengers.

00:05:24.030 --> 00:05:30.360
Right now click here to learn more about Avengers
2 and click here for my top picks for Captain

00:05:30.360 --> 00:05:31.360
America 3.

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:33.040
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:33.310
High Fives!

